Package: jwm-style-editor
Version: @VERSION@-1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Luciano Biancardine <lucianobiancardine@gmail.com>
Depends: python3:any (>= 3.9), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, libfontconfig1, jwm (>= 2.4)
Recommends: fonts-dejavu-core
Homepage: https://github.com/lucianobianc/JWM-Tools
Description: graphical style editor and live preview for JWM
 Edit JWM colors, fonts, borders and title buttons with a GTK 3 interface.
 Includes 34 built-in palettes, custom styles and a Cairo desktop preview.
 Applies selected XML changes while preserving unrelated configuration,
 keeping a backup and checking for external modifications.
